    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061201.0459\n\nMOSUL, Dec 1 , 2006, 2006\n\n14 Kurds found murdered in northern Iraq\n\n\n\n\nIraqi police found 14 Kurdish farmers murdered in a field near the Syrian border, a government official said Friday.\n\nThe farmers from the town of Sinjar were shot dead and their bodies were first found by their relatives, said Dakheel Karim, administrator of Sinjar some 50 kilometres (30 miles) from the Syrian border.",
